---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description="RyFab Motorsports is a one-person fabrication shop run by Ryan Field — custom fabrication, wiring, and setup for street, autocross and track cars.">
  <main>
    <section class="section section--tight">
      <div class="container about-grid">
        <div class="about-copy">
          <div class="section-head">
            <h1>About</h1>
            <p class="lead">I'm Ryan, and RyFab Motorsports is just me.</p>
          </div>

          <article class="prose">
            <p>
              I grew up on planes, trains, and automobiles. Saturday mornings meant Speed Channel,
              not cartoons. I've lived and breathed racing ever since, and I still do.
            </p>
            <p>
              Today I compete in a handful of motorsports myself and build and work on other
              people's race cars. It's the childhood dream, and I take it seriously. I know what
              it's like to have a car down on the weekend of an event, and I build everything
              like it's going on my own car.
            </p>
            <h2>How I work</h2>
            <p>
              I do the work myself, from the first conversation to the last bolt. Whether it's a
              custom exhaust, a wiring harness, or setting up the suspension, you're talking to the
              person who's actually doing it.
            </p>
            <p>
              Rates are fair and there are no surprises. If something changes along the way, I'll
              tell you before I do it. The shop is appointment-only, so <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>
              first and tell me about your car.
            </p>
          </article>

          <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Contact me</a>
        </div>

        <div class="placeholder placeholder--4-3 about-photo">
          <span>Photo of me / the shop</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-12);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about-copy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-6); align-items: flex-start; }
  .about-copy .prose a { color: var(--text-primary); text-decoration: underline; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
